IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0026.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 MAX-TERM           PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    05 ELIGIBLE-FLAG      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "MAX-TERM=" MAX-TERM
    DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE-FLAG=" ELIGIBLE-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF CLNT-AGE >= 18
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> SHORT TERM FOR OLDER BORROWERS
            WHEN CLNT-AGE > 60
                MOVE 10 TO MAX-TERM
                MOVE 'Y' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
            WHEN CLNT-AGE > 50
                MOVE 20 TO MAX-TERM
                MOVE 'Y' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 30 TO MAX-TERM
                MOVE 'Y' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO ELIGIBLE-FLAG
    END-IF.
